From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leaf Performance experiments <noreply@localhost>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Narrow framed-map holder scans

For framed map updates, process only the holder associated with the current
viewer instead of rescanning every map holder for every viewer. Handheld and
dropped-map calls keep the complete holder scan; renderer, decoration, frame,
and packet update paths remain unchanged.

Source: Lithium 26.1.x entity.framed_maps MapItemSavedDataMixin, 2No2Name,
revision 701fb2e7636c6d634c76380c11232d27fd578dff.
License: LGPL-3.0-only; adapted to current Leaf/Paper map tracking.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/saveddata/maps/MapItemSavedData.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/saveddata/maps/MapItemSavedData.java
index 53b4dff..3b892f4 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/level/saveddata/maps/MapItemSavedData.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/level/saveddata/maps/MapItemSavedData.java
@@ -209,8 +209,13 @@ public class MapItemSavedData extends SavedData {
             this.removeDecoration(tickingPlayer.getPlainTextName());
         }
 
-        for (int i = 0; i < this.carriedBy.size(); i++) {
-            MapItemSavedData.HoldingPlayer otherHoldingPlayer = this.carriedBy.get(i);
+        // Leaf-Performance start - Lithium - avoid framed map viewer x holder scans
+        int holdingPlayerCount = placedInFrame == null ? this.carriedBy.size() : 1;
+        for (int i = 0; i < holdingPlayerCount; i++) {
+            MapItemSavedData.HoldingPlayer otherHoldingPlayer = placedInFrame == null
+                ? this.carriedBy.get(i)
+                : this.carriedByPlayers.get(tickingPlayer);
+            // Leaf-Performance end - Lithium - avoid framed map viewer x holder scans
             Player otherPlayer = otherHoldingPlayer.player;
             String otherPlayerName = otherPlayer.getPlainTextName();
             if (!otherPlayer.isRemoved() && (placedInFrame != null || otherPlayer.getInventory().containsMap(mapItem, mapId))) {
